//Feature là 1 chức năng, 1 user story
Feature: Login to CRM
  As a user, I want to be able to log into the CRM system
  So that I can manage customer information

//Background là pre-condition
  Background:
    Given a web browser is on the Google page

//Senario same như từng testcase, từng @test, có đầy đủ description, pre-conditon của từng TC, test steps và expected result
  @ValidLogin
  Scenario: Successful login
    Given Navigate to login page
    When Enter username "Admin" and password "admin123"
    And Click the Login button
    Then I should be taken to the Dashboard page

  @InvalidLogin
  Scenario: Login fail
    Given Navigate to login page
    When Enter username "" and password "admin123"
    And Click the Login button
    Then I should be taken to the Dashboard page

  @InvalidLoginMultiple
  Scenario: Invalid Login with multiple account
    Given Navigate to login page
    When Enter invalid username and password
    And Click the Login button
    Then Navigate to the Dashboard page
      | username          | password |
      | user@example.com  | 123      |
      | admin@example.com | 123456   |
    Then An error message is displayed
